# x11-bench (W16-S05): user/x11/xbench times the desktop in one go, from a
# busybox shell with no X server up (it starts and stops Xfbdev itself).
# Not in make test; make x11-bench checks the numbers against budgets.
wait burrow>
type run /bin/busybox sh
key ret
wait built-in shell
type /opt/x11/bin/xbench; exit
key ret
wait xbench: done
wait burrow>
type poweroff
key ret
